OL,3,CDad dies in Thailand days before his
OL,4,Cwedding after motorcycle incident
OL,6,FA dad has died in Thailand just days
OL,7,Fbefore his wedding, leaving family
OL,8,Fwith "unimaginable heartbreak."
OL,10,FKyle Campbell, 32, from Westhoughton,
OL,11,FBolton died after sustaining a head
OL,12,Finjury in a motorcycle accident.
OL,14,FHis family said he was taken to a
OL,15,Flocal hospital where he was treated
OL,16,Fand then discharged. He later died as
OL,17,Fa result of his injuries.
OL,19,FRelatives said: "Our family have since
OL,20,Fbeen informed that the medical care he
OL,21,Freceived was inadequate."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
