OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786103286
OL,3,CDad dies in Thailand days before his
OL,4,Cwedding after motorcycle incident
OL,6,FOn a fundraising page, his family said
OL,7,Fthey were facing "unimaginable pain."
OL,9,FThey said: "Kyle travelled to Thailand
OL,10,Fto marry his partner of two and a half
OL,11,Fyears, looking forward to beginning
OL,12,Fthe next chapter of their lives
OL,13,Ftogether. What should have been a
OL,14,Fjoyful occasion ended in unimaginable
OL,15,Fheartbreak.
OL,17,F"His death has devastated everyone who
OL,18,Fknew and loved him.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
