OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786103286
OL,3,CDad dies in Thailand days before his
OL,4,Cwedding after motorcycle incident
OL,6,F"He leaves behind his precious 12-year-
OL,7,Fold son, who lived with him, as well
OL,8,Fas family and friends who are now
OL,9,Ffacing the unimaginable pain of losing
OL,10,Fhim so suddenly.
OL,12,F"We are now faced with the enormous
OL,13,Ffinancial burden of bringing Kyle home
OL,14,Fto the UK so that he can be reunited
OL,15,Fwith his family and laid to rest with
OL,16,Fthe dignity and love he deserves.
OL,18,F"The funds raised will go towards the
OL,19,Fcosts of repatriation, funeral
OL,20,Fexpenses, and the unexpected costs
OL,21,Fthat come with such a tragic loss."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
